ほぼ必要最低限のことしかしゃべらないため、ミステリアスな印象を持たれやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天涯孤独の身で、プライベートはわりと謎に包まれている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24593","sourceWorkId":"32484","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"AVメーカーのマネージャー兼現役AV女優。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールで落ち着いた印象ながらも、AVではハードな内容の作品にも多く出演している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"出演作品はそれぞれ評判も高く、熱烈なファンも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近は出演本数を減らし、現場マネージャーとして新人AV女優たちの面倒を見ることが増えた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口数は少なく表情の変化も乏しいため、初対面の相手からは怖がられることも多いが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見は良く、多くの新人たちから慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女優としてもマネージャーとしても有能で、会社からは重宝されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほぼ必要最低限のことしかしゃべらないため、ミステリアスな印象を持たれやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天涯孤独の身で、プライベートはわりと謎に包まれている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110115"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/9122b203529fc6e52740d0a6696be6ad08d26e98fffe5d1884af414574869249.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2a99740ab9e5ebc48d729dfa60a6679feddcf121535bab2efad0cab5bdb3086.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"たくみ みえ","creatorId":"vndb:s33523","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s33523","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s33523","name":"たくみ みえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90884","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c155922","characterName":"佐久間 利蔵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c155922"},"originalCharacterName":"佐久間 利蔵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The president of a major entertainment agency."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the directors of Minomori Private Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Possessing a mysterious charisma, he has often acted as a leader in groups since he was young."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"During this time, he gathered together a group of entertainer and model scouts and founded an entertainment talent agency."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A man who will stop at nothing to succeed, he has used various methods to rise to the top and become a respected figure in the entertainment industry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There are endless dark rumors surrounding both him and his agency, but they are all just rumors."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c155922"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c19ea29c5c4442e2da700780709a9e1b99110cc6ccc12d68c1e56eb1b5523791.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9c037e178f37db146616c327115ee04faf74c1368394b8253a330e76a5e88f3.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c155923","characterName":"貝川 善久","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c155923"},"originalCharacterName":"貝川 善久","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"President of an adult video manufacturer and director."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He originally worked as a manager at Sakuma's talent agency, but his love of women was so great that he often made advances on celebrities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His talent as an adult video director was later discovered, and he started his own adult video manufacturer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His hobby is amateur sex videos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId"